<title>FRANCE: Press Digest - France - No April 10 Le Monde.</title>
<headline>Press Digest - France - No April 10 Le Monde.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Due to a strike by printers' unions, which has prevented the publication of French newspapers, afternoon daily Le Monde will not be published on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
</text>
